# after a bare "--" it is required: an empty answer runs nothing).
# An answer equal to its prefill (dir, cli) is treated as empty. {ask:resume} is a checkbox:
# --resume, or --continue when another cli is chosen (a session cannot move between CLIs).
# when: catalog | running | live (running catalog agent) | stopped | dir. Optional: confirm,
# key (Tk event), default (running | stopped: double-click/Enter on such a row), detach (start without waiting), cwd,
# if_exists (a path with {dir}; the button is enabled only while it exists).
